(
F5 W1 U6: mrange maximum_range_length (manual Professional 4.55, initialization
 part). The index range -ra 1 2 3 4 -ra holds 4 entries; mrange 4 allows it
 (Professional 02-08-2026: mrange 4 accepted, 3 rejected; a range
 -ra -from 1 -to 4 -ra counts 4 words; the expanded list counts too).
 One quad4, E 1000, poisson 0, top nodes pushed down by 0.01: sigyy -10,
 = Professional 02-08-2026.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
mrange 4
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 2 3 4 -ra -velx
bounda_dof 1 -ra 1 2 -ra -vely
bounda_dof 2 -ra 3 4 -ra -vely
bounda_time 2 0 0 1 -0.01
control_timestep 0 1 1
target_item 0 -node_dof 4 -sigyy
target_value 0 -10. 1.e-8
end_data
